-system-core","objective":"完整识别资本劳动力技术信息房地产五类要素市场","prompt":"下列哪组均属于生产要素市场？","options":["资本、劳动力、技术、信息、房地产市场","消费品、生产资料、生活服务以及各类商品零售市场","商品、资本、劳动力三个市场支柱和消费品市场"],"answer":0,"explanation":"资本、劳动力、技术、信息和房地产均属于生产要素市场。","boundary":"三大支柱不是生产要素市场的完整清单。","refs":[{"pointId":"market-system-composition","tabId":"factor-market","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p6-factor-market-list"],"fingerprint":"ca9f2443","label":"市场体系 · 生产要素市场","auditStatus":"ready-for-user-acceptance"}],"kind":"自编学习题","assessmentType":"learning-card","examBasis":{"originType":"self-authored","displayLabel":"自编学习题"},"specification":{"questionId":"factor-market","primaryTargetIds":["cs-target-factor-market"],"supportingTargetIds":[],"checkPurpose":"q2-economics-market-system","distractorReasons":{"1":"消费品和生产资料属于商品市场。","2":"三大支柱不是要素市场完整清单，商品市场也不是生产要素。"},"cognitiveLevel":"application"}},{"id":"market-system-pillars","revision":2,"status":"review","scope":"economics","group":"market-system-core","objective":"识别商品资本劳动力市场三大支柱","prompt":"市场体系的三大支柱是下列哪一组？","options":["商品市场、资本市场、劳动力市场","消费品市场、技术市场、信息市场","生产资料市场、房地产市场、服务市场"],"answer":0,"explanation":"商品市场、资本市场和劳动力市场构成市场体系三大支柱。","boundary":"三大支柱不等于两大分类，也不等于全部要素市场。","refs":[{"pointId":"market-system-composition","tabId":"market-pillars","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p6-market-pillars-list"],"fingerprint":"7fa607db","label":"市场体系 · 三大支柱","auditStatus":"ready-for-user-acceptance"}],"kind":"自编学习题","assessmentType":"learning-card","examBasis":{"originType":"self-authored","displayLabel":"自编学习题"},"specification":{"questionId":"market-system-pillars","primaryTargetIds":["cs-target-market-system-pillars"],"supportingTargetIds":[],"checkPurpose":"q2-economics-market-system","distractorReasons":{"1":"技术与信息虽属要素市场，但不在三大支柱组合中。","2":"生产资料与房地产也不构成三大支柱组合。"},"cognitiveLevel":"application"}},{"id":"market-system-full","revision":2,"status":"review","scope":"economics","group":"market-system-core","objective":"综合复辨两大分类内部范围和三大支柱","prompt":"关于市场体系的分类层级，下列说法正确的是？","options":["两大类是商品与要素市场；商品分消费品和生产资料